// D51: `charter verify --invariant <name>` restricts every backend to the named invariant.
// `never-flagged` is violated in one step; `never-sealed` holds. Asked about `never-sealed`
// alone, `finite` and `thresholds` must say it is verified and count one invariant; asked
// about `never-flagged`, or about both, they must report the violation.
Fact member Identified by Ann.
Fact flagged Identified by member.
Fact sealed Identified by member.

Act flag Actor member
  Holds when True
  Creates flagged(member).

Invariant never-flagged
  When !(Exists flagged: flagged).

Invariant never-sealed
  When !(Exists sealed: sealed).
